---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Pebble Error Codes"
  description="Decode common Pebble FE error codes and connection troubleshooting steps."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Sadface decoder</p>
      <h1>Error codes</h1>
      <p>When the watch throws a hex tantrum, start here.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:860px">
      <img
        src="/images/FE504510_FE504511_FE504512.JPG"
        alt="Pebble showing FE504510 FE504511 FE504512"
        style="border-radius:16px; border:1px solid var(--line); margin-bottom:1.5rem"
      />

      <article class="panel" style="padding:1.5rem">
        <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem">FE504510 · FE504511 · FE504512</h2>
        <p class="muted">Usually a phone ↔ watch connection snarl rather than a dead brick.</p>
        <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem; margin-top:1.25rem">Try this order</h3>
        <ol style="color:var(--muted); padding-left:1.1rem">
          <li style="margin-bottom:0.45rem">Restart the Pebble (hold Back ~10 seconds).</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:0.45rem">Restart the phone.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:0.45rem">Confirm Bluetooth is on and the watch is in range.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:0.45rem">Forget the Pebble in Bluetooth settings, then re-pair from the companion app.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:0.45rem">Reinstall the Pebble / Core app if pairing still fails.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:0.45rem">Last resort: factory reset the watch (you will re-download apps).</li>
        </ol>
      </article>

      <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top:1.25rem">
        <img src="/images/FE504502.JPG" alt="Additional FE error example" style="border-radius:14px; border:1px solid var(--line)" />
        <img src="/images/FE504502_FE504503_FE504504.JPG" alt="FE504502 FE504503 FE504504" style="border-radius:14px; border:1px solid var(--line)" />
      </div>

      <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:2rem">
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/repair">← Repair hub</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/community">Ask the community</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
